@               Configuration Editor (Device Editor SubMenu)
               --------------------------------------------

This editor allows you to modify the device configuration information.

Field Description:
------------------
1. NI-VXI Path:
                     Access path to configuration and help files.
2. SYSRESET resets VXIcpu-030:
                     If selected 1 then a SYSRESET on the back plane
                     reboots the VXIcpu-030.
3. PB asserts SYSRESET:
                     If selected 1 then a Push Button Reset assert SYSRESET on 
                     the back plane

4. PB asserts LclReset:
                     If selected 1 then a Push Button Reset assert Local Reset.


Usage
-----
It supports the following commands:

(1) list      [<index#>,[<index#>]] - lists all the entries in the 
				      specified range.
(2) display   [<index#>,[<index#>]] - displays the entries in details.
(3) modify    <index#>              - lets you modify an existing entry.
(4) save                            - lets you save the information.
(5) abort                           - lets you exit the editor,
                                      ignoring the changes made.
(6) exit                            - lets you exit the editor.
(7) help                            - gives help on that editor.
@


